# ID: DSA-033
# Category: strings
# Algorithm: string reversal
# Exercises: padham line input, podavu, padham indexing, char to padham cast, padham concatenation, descending range via pratisari
# Difficulty: easy
# Expected: the input line reversed, then its length
padham s
s ni chaduvu
padham r
r lo "" pettu
pratisari (int i lo podavu(s) - 1 pettu; i >= 0; i--) {
    r lo r + (padham) s[i] pettu
}
r ni chupi
podavu(r) ni chupi
